#: ../../legacy/cmucam4/mobot.rst:8
msgid "Project Description"
msgstr "Deskripsi Proyek"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam4/mobot.rst:10
msgid ""
"In Carnegie Mellon's Mobot competition, robots must pass through a series of"
" 14 gates positioned over a 255-foot curved white line on an outdoor "
"sidewalk. The course includes two steep ramps and a decision point area "
"where the robot must select the correct route to pass through 14 gates in "
"serial order. Since the line is outdoors and under Pittsburgh's weather, the"
" robot must function in a variety of conditions. This year it was rainy and "
"windy on competition day. More information can be found at "
"http://www.cs.cmu.edu/mobot/mobot.html"
msgstr ""
"Dalam kompetisi Mobot Carnegie Mellon, robot harus melewati serangkaian 14 "
"gerbang yang ditempatkan di atas garis putih melengkung sepanjang 255 kaki "
"di trotoar luar ruangan. Lintasan ini mencakup dua tanjakan curam dan area "
"titik keputusan di mana robot harus memilih rute yang benar untuk melewati "
"14 gerbang secara berurutan. Karena garis berada di luar ruangan dan di "
"bawah cuaca Pittsburgh, robot harus berfungsi dalam berbagai kondisi. Tahun "
"ini hujan dan berangin pada hari kompetisi. Informasi lebih lanjut dapat "
"ditemukan di http://www.cs.cmu.edu/mobot/mobot.html"

